    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for an epic gaming experience with Stars Survivor, the ultimate multiplayer space combat game ! \ud83c\udfae Dive into a thrilling intergalactic universe where you must compete for survival and glory. Engage in intense and breathtaking space battles against players from around the world, and prove your dominance in a variety of exciting game modes.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Be the last survivor to claim victory!\u00a0 Take on other pilots in a fierce competition where strategy and skill are crucial to triumph.</strong>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GLOBAL RANKING SYSTEM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Battle Royale mode, put your skills to the test in competitive ranked matches. Climb the divisions and leagues to rank among the best pilots in the universe! Your rank will be proudly displayed in the global leaderboard.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > CUSTOMIZATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn XP by winning battles and unlock a variety of unique items in the Space Pass, our exclusive battle pass. Customize your spaceships with lasers, thrusters, and much more! \ud83d\udd27\ud83d\ude80 </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >IN-GAME CURRENCY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn Planetary by playing and completing challenges. Use them to purchase cosmetic items, upgrades, and special equipment from the daily store.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > STRATEGY<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824910/extras/7a5c6b91a2dd5942ebc1045e0cee9a50.poster.avif?t=1735558226\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824910/extras/7a5c6b91a2dd5942ebc1045e0cee9a50.webm?t=1735558226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824910/extras/7a5c6b91a2dd5942ebc1045e0cee9a50.mp4?t=1735558226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824910/extras/d9be9a6a9fc4baa936db2a718897df7a.poster.avif?t=1735558226\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824910/extras/d9be9a6a9fc4baa936db2a718897df7a.webm?t=1735558226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824910/extras/d9be9a6a9fc4baa936db2a718897df7a.mp4?t=1735558226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Explore different planets on the map and destroy them to collect bonuses like missiles, speed boosts, static mines, repair packs, and more. Use them wisely to gain an edge over your opponents in space combat.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > PLAY WITH YOUR FRIENDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite your friends to join you in this space adventure. Team up or engage in friendly duels to determine who's the top space pilot!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Download Stars Survivor for free now and embark on an unparalleled intergalactic gaming journey! Let the battle for survival and glory begin!\u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note: In-app purchases are available for players looking to acquire Planetary more quickly and access exclusive items.\u00a0</p>",
