ore_item_assets/steam/apps/2824910/extras/7a5c6b91a2dd5942ebc1045e0cee9a50.mp4?t=1735558226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824910/extras/d9be9a6a9fc4baa936db2a718897df7a.poster.avif?t=1735558226\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824910/extras/d9be9a6a9fc4baa936db2a718897df7a.webm?t=1735558226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824910/extras/d9be9a6a9fc4baa936db2a718897df7a.mp4?t=1735558226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Explore different planets on the map and destroy them to collect bonuses like missiles, speed boosts, static mines, repair packs, and more. Use them wisely to gain an edge over your opponents in space combat.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > PLAY WITH YOUR FRIENDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite your friends to join you in this space adventure. Team up or engage in friendly duels to determine who's the top space pilot!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Download Stars Survivor for free now and embark on an unparalleled intergalactic gaming journey! Let the battle for survival and glory begin!\u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note: In-app purchases are available for players looking to acquire Planetary more quickly and access exclusive items.\u00a0</p>",
